{"game": "roboquest", "language": "english", "appid": 692890, "month": "2021-08", "window": 4, "start_date": 1629763200, "end_date": 1630454399, "month_true_total": 175, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-03 01:49:20 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "98585851", "author": {"steamid": "76561198008476410", "personaname": "7IdE", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/thefuckamidoinghere/", "num_games_owned": 477, "num_reviews": 48, "playtime_forever": 565, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 337, "last_played": 1754739104, "avatar": "b7255561cdf6093a5a8b43b803529622249fadc8"}, "language": "english", "review": "What a good actionium.\nReally breathtaking game.\nYes, it's kinda quick, but the fun you get here is priceless.", "timestamp_created": 1630448951, "timestamp_updated": 1630448951, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "98570470", "author": {"steamid": "76561198020177616", "personaname": "Kajet", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/kajetokun/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 6473, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 977, "last_played": 1733972572, "avatar": "a4c55de686fd8e7c2b12e51517cf0edd867a6256"}, "language": "english", "review": "Fast paced, really snappy controls, cool movement options, 10/10 soundtrack. If you love fast paced shooters, you'll love this. It can be played slower and more methodically, and the perk pools and weapons support that playstyle, but with disappearing EXP orbs on high difficulties and an extra random stat every A-rank you get, you're incentivized to have an aggressive playstyle, something I personally look for in shooters. And boy is it fun flying around sliding and jumping and getting those precision shots while schmoving all over the enemies. \n\nGame is in early access though. Curb your expectations. There's not a lot of variation or random encounters in its levels that you'd expect in a roguelike, yet at the same time theres a surprising amount paths and secrets for an early access game.", "timestamp_created": 1630426138, "timestamp_updated": 1630426138, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "98546499", "author": {"steamid": "76561198856445750", "personaname": "Benny_Buns", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198856445750/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 18, "playtime_forever": 893, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 502, "last_played": 1747024855, "avatar": "5b41113a4c492ac1b1a67ccd76be72de6af8bd4d"}, "language": "english", "review": "I like a jumpin on der heads", "timestamp_created": 1630388003, "timestamp_updated": 1630388003, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 3, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "98530367", "author": {"steamid": "76561198275289381", "personaname": "Rayner", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198275289381/", "num_games_owned": 292, "num_reviews": 22, "playtime_forever": 2907, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2135, "last_played": 1694330774, "avatar": "4985ef82fb5eeda9762e01c5a0e884bc41